msgid ""
"A root partition is needed to install Linux Mint on.\n"
"\n"
" - Mount point: /\n"
" - Recommended size: 30GB\n"
" - Recommended filesystem format: ext4\n"
msgstr ""
"Root partition je potrebná pre inštaláciu Linuxu Mint.\n"
"\n"
"- Mount point:/\n"
"- Odporúčaná veľkosť je: 30GB\n"
